# recordstream: the Keras backend, and variables a pipeline references as $NAME (docs/sources.md)

# KERAS_BACKEND=torch   torch | tensorflow | jax — Keras 3 backend; unset = the first installed one (recordstream.keras)
# DATA_ROOT=/path/to/datasets   folder of the datasets; configs write $DATA_ROOT/... (docs/sources.md)
# REF_SNR=   example of a numeric pipeline setting read as "$REF_SNR" by resolve_expression; any $NAME works the same way
